      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "children复数且yesterday morning过去，were同时满足；are时态不合，is数和时态都不合。"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "stem": "—____ books are in your bag?\n—Four.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "How many"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "How much"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "How old"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "rationale": "books可数复数且Four答数量，How many对应；How much不可数或价格、How old年龄不合。"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "stem": "My mother is a good driver. She drives ____.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "careful"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "carefully"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "care"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "修饰drives方式用副词carefully；careful形容词、care名词或动词，均不作此处方式修饰。"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "stem": "Ben is 150 cm tall and Leo is 140 cm tall. Leo is ____ than Ben.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "short"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "shortest"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "shorter"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "140<150，than后比较用shorter；short原级、shortest最高级不合。"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "stem": "—Did you ____ the letter last night?\n—Yes, I did.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "wrote"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "write"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "writing"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "did问句主语后的实义动词用原形write；wrote过去式重复标过去，writing非限定不合。"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "stem": "These two pencils belong to me. They are ____.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "mine"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "my"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "me"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "rationale": "无后接名词的所属表语用mine；my需后接名词，me宾格不表此处所属。"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "stem": "We plan to visit Grandma next Sunday. We ____ there by bus that day.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "went"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "going"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "will go"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "next Sunday/that day指计划中的将来，will go符合；went过去，going缺助动词。"
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "stem": "The meeting is ____ Friday afternoon.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "at"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "on"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "in"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "明确星期的下午用on；at钟点、in泛指下午但不用于这个带Friday的时间短语。"
    },
    {
